window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-130-2935203f39f9c99f.json"]={sha256:"2935203f39f9c99f77b660a9188855f396e5e688212453c65866cebeaa0b09ad",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-cf57a9aec0dacbb7","url":"https://dvb.org/?standard=second-generation-framing-structure-channel-coding-and-modulation-systems-for-broadcasting-interactive-services-news-gathering-and-other-broadband-satellite-applications-part-1-dvb-s2","title":"DVB-S2: EN 302 307-1 V1.4.1","titleEn":"DVB-S2: EN 302 307-1 V1.4.1","publisher":"DVB Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-130","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-130","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-131","referenceUrls":["https://deepspace.jpl.nasa.gov/dsndocs/810-005/"],"title":"NASA DSN：由載波雜訊密度到位元能量","titleEn":"NASA DSN: from carrier-to-noise density to bit energy","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 9 Mbit/s useful estimate 與 18 Mbit/s useful estimate，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 9 Mbit/s useful estimate and 18 Mbit/s useful estimate, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋30 dB Eb/N0與20 dB Eb/N0，建立dsn_energy.csv、dB與線性對照、率定義與鏈路餘裕表，並完成以下驗收：若所需Eb/N0加損失共22 dB，第一組餘裕8 dB、第二組-2 dB，後者不得通過；閾值僅為本題。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 30 dB Eb/N0 and 20 dB Eb/N0; create dsn_energy.csv, linear/dB cross-checks, rate definitions and a link-margin table; apply this acceptance decision: For an assumed requirement including losses of22 dB, margins are8 and-2 dB; reject the second case. The threshold belongs only to this exercise.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 調變bits/symbol乘碼率再扣框架效率得到近似淨率；MODCOD的可靠度還需對應接收條件。 展開基準式 10*2*0.5*0.9；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：先逐符元資訊1與2bit再乘率與效率；將PLHEADER等開銷另列，不把0.9視為所有DVB框固定值。 將兩條推導一起存入 dvbs2_modcod.csv、每符元資訊表、模式回退證據。","從原理 Eb/N0(dB)=C/N0(dB-Hz)-10log10(Rb)；固定接收功率時降資料率可提高每位元能量，尚須扣實作損失。 展開基準式 60-10*log10(1000)；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：在線性域以10^6 Hz除以1000或10000 bit/s得1000與100，再轉dB；分清資訊率與編碼位元率。 將兩條推導一起存入 dsn_energy.csv、dB與線性對照、率定義與鏈路餘裕表。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Approximate useful rate multiplies modulation bits, code rate and frame efficiency; MODCOD reliability also depends on reception conditions., expand baseline expression 10*2*0.5*0.9; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Compute1/2 information bits per symbol, then rate and efficiency;0.9 is a fixture, not a universal DVB frame constant. Save both derivations with dvbs2_modcod.csv, information-per-symbol table and mode-fallback evidence.","Starting from Eb/N0 in dB equals C/N0 in dB-Hz minus10log10(Rb); lower rate raises energy per bit at fixed received power, before implementation losses., expand baseline expression 60-10*log10(1000); record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: In linear units divide10^6 Hz by1000 or10000 bit/s to obtain1000 and100, then convert to dB; distinguish information and coded rates. Save both derivations with dsn_energy.csv, linear/dB cross-checks, rate definitions and a link-margin table.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-140","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/learn/basics-of-space-flight/chapter10-1/"],"title":"DSN 地面站交接：重疊視窗與擷取餘裕","titleEn":"DSN ground-station handover: overlap and acquisition margin","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 9 Mbit/s useful estimate 與 18 Mbit/s useful estimate，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 9 Mbit/s useful estimate and 18 Mbit/s useful estimate, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋30 seconds handover timing margin與-30 seconds handover timing margin，建立dsn_handover.csv、兩站時間軸、缺口與緩存需求表，並完成以下驗收：連續服務要求餘裕非負，120 s通過、60 s不通過；失敗情境須明示30 s缺口或安排儲存轉送。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 30 seconds handover timing margin and -30 seconds handover timing margin; create dsn_handover.csv, a two-station timeline and gap/buffering requirements; apply this acceptance decision: Continuous service requires nonnegative margin:120 s passes and60 s fails; declare the30 s gap or plan store-and-forward recovery.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 調變bits/symbol乘碼率再扣框架效率得到近似淨率；MODCOD的可靠度還需對應接收條件。 展開基準式 10*2*0.5*0.9；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：先逐符元資訊1與2bit再乘率與效率；將PLHEADER等開銷另列，不把0.9視為所有DVB框固定值。 將兩條推導一起存入 dvbs2_modcod.csv、每符元資訊表、模式回退證據。","從原理 連續接收的交接需要下一站擷取及保護時間落在可重疊視窗內；時間餘裕比單站訊號強度更能暴露排程缺口。 展開基準式 120-75-15；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：把舊站結束置t=0，新站可見起點為-120或-60；擷取與保護結束在-30或+30，直接讀時間軸。 將兩條推導一起存入 dsn_handover.csv、兩站時間軸、缺口與緩存需求表。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Approximate useful rate multiplies modulation bits, code rate and frame efficiency; MODCOD reliability also depends on reception conditions., expand baseline expression 10*2*0.5*0.9; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Compute1/2 information bits per symbol, then rate and efficiency;0.9 is a fixture, not a universal DVB frame constant. Save both derivations with dvbs2_modcod.csv, information-per-symbol table and mode-fallback evidence.","Starting from Continuous reception requires the next station acquisition and guard time to fit in the overlap; timing margin reveals schedule gaps that signal strength alone cannot., expand baseline expression 120-75-15; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Set old-station end to t0 and new-station visibility to-120 or-60; acquisition plus guard ends at-30 or+30, independently exposing the margin. Save both derivations with dsn_handover.csv, a two-station timeline and gap/buffering requirements.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-c654a2fdd8a46a25","url":"https://deepspace.jpl.nasa.gov/dsndocs/810-005/","title":"DSN Telecommunications Link Design Handbook 810-005","titleEn":"DSN Telecommunications Link Design Handbook 810-005","publisher":"NASA / JPL","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-76cde582675d7b6c","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/learn/basics-of-space-flight/chapter10-1/","title":"Basics of Space Flight: Telecom","titleEn":"Basics of Space Flight: Telecom","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
